{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tornado Chaser</strong> is the wild multiplayer storm-chasing game where you can yell at your friends and watch them be sucked into huge tornadoes! Grab your gear, hop in your '<i>very safe'</i> vehicles, and race into the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with friends or go rogue, to chase the largest, and most dangerous tornadoes the world has seen. When the storms die down, you can go fishing, explore weird roadside attractions, or just enjoy the calm before the next chaos spiral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187640/extras/fishing.gif?t=1751070614\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tornado Chaser</i> is part tornado, part silly, and 100% chaos. Perfect for anyone who\u2019s ever said, \u201cLet\u2019s drive <i>into</i> the tornado and see what happens!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187640/extras/driving.gif?t=1751070614\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3187640?t=1751070614","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3187640?t=1751070614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187640/525b921d8ad09e096ab6ecc47b03148ef438dc60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751070614","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187640/525b921d8ad09e096ab6ecc47b03148ef438dc60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751070614","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descr